    "draftSubject":  "Streamlining Revenue Cycle Workflows",
    "draftBody":  "Dear Victoria,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I recently reviewed Harris Health System\u0027s strategic plan and noted your focus on revenue-cycle optimization and enhancing collections. Given the complexity of your financial assistance eligibility workflows, I believe CapSigma can provide valuable support.\n\nOur disciplined approach to data operations includes forms and records digitization, which can streamline your eligibility-document intake and improve processing times. We also offer data cleansing and enrichment services that can enhance the accuracy of your revenue-cycle data.\n\nTo demonstrate our capabilities, I would like to propose a no-cost pilot focused on eligibility-document intake or workflow cleanup. This could help identify areas for improvement and support your strategic goals.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss this further.\n\nBest regards,\n\nNiyi Olumide, PMP, CSM  \nGeneral Manager, CapSigma",
